    },
    {
      "audioUrl": "/audio/learning/745ab38ba1cb080968f9.m4a",
      "spokenText": "はしおかいます。",
      "bytes": 13577,
      "durationSeconds": 1.36771,
      "sha256": "6a4e65cc895f69d7e994e1cbcb32944119cffe13554af4c9cfd85aa5946e50f2"
    },
    {
      "audioUrl": "/audio/learning/fc4f895b63eab06eb017.m4a",
      "spokenText": "きょねんにほんでとけいおかいました。",
      "bytes": 22080,
      "durationSeconds": 2.732608,
      "sha256": "1153a360021190d62934e4cdb171af7157f1e8e174eac9d7452d6a6f475d4961"
    },
    {
      "audioUrl": "/audio/learning/f46cbad2ebbeec76e346.m4a",
      "spokenText": "このティーシャツわすてきですね。",
      "bytes": 19945,
      "durationSeconds": 2.362268,
      "sha256": "00ac3b4388429d4205d44dd674be019cc40f9a38c2066e432a0fd14826ab2022"
    },
    {
      "audioUrl": "/audio/learning/4ad62d3d691823bd2fe1.m4a",
      "spokenText": "サイズわエムです。",
      "bytes": 13898,
      "durationSeconds": 1.444943,
      "sha256": "a4896275159fe1bb0f31d3783b33a695e15dcae576a68d79143b1df47b5fa0ca"
    },
    {
      "audioUrl": "/audio/learning/97afffcb634fb5f21606.m4a",
      "spokenText": "このバッグわたかいです。",
      "bytes": 17564,
