      "durationSeconds": 1.75873,
      "sha256": "8d690fddee4d75db757cc5adc22b0759cf4fe88f99c1f040befdb35b551c3189"
    },
    {
      "audioUrl": "/audio/learning/e35d3d091de12180f5ec.m4a",
      "spokenText": "やすみわどうでしたか。",
      "bytes": 16946,
      "durationSeconds": 1.943764,
      "sha256": "91d0dff216c6330cc2729d1493104c7fa404c3ebe015353381e177524d2ef01e"
    },
    {
      "audioUrl": "/audio/learning/397fee0987506deb2a2f.m4a",
      "spokenText": "そうじわたいへんでした。",
      "bytes": 17135,
      "durationSeconds": 1.9561,
      "sha256": "59d0b48c11cbd3568c8185f286971fe78a7b584d0f4775878c1cfbd0e14595ac"
    },
    {
      "audioUrl": "/audio/learning/b9be217775003f7162d4.m4a",
      "spokenText": "えいがわおもしろかったです。",
      "bytes": 18961,
      "durationSeconds": 2.222358,
      "sha256": "13df20be8e0125a7179b744b4ec9724b06493f7dd6a521ee455cc0bc3c97088e"
    },
    {
      "audioUrl": "/audio/learning/7151b4b8ed3ce5c1d5f9.m4a",
      "spokenText": "ともだちとカラオケおしました。",
      "bytes": 20907,
      "durationSeconds": 2.529887,
      "sha256": "efb3e58fba8d6f2af0d8a9128a825a824f41e68b7cc7ca0054db9c5e7d51a0a7"
    },
    {
      "audioUrl": "/audio/learning/b99bcc40f49ba08d9bb0.m4a",
      "spokenText": "きのうわつかれました。",
