      "durationSeconds": 1.5722,
      "sha256": "fe49138e9786d31d4a0c1ca9889ba2b19f1bae2133f05687e8c01565a24f3224"
    },
    {
      "audioUrl": "/audio/learning/d3c611a0d1f321849f4b.m4a",
      "spokenText": "かぶきわきれいでした。そしておもしろかったです。",
      "bytes": 29068,
      "durationSeconds": 3.917415,
      "sha256": "f48d79a065a2f90fa75944231f4a1af89f8a5c1cddcbf0dd025ea3da4376b503"
    },
    {
      "audioUrl": "/audio/learning/4f041190c903ab897eee.m4a",
      "spokenText": "つぎわきょうとにいきたいです。",
      "bytes": 20123,
      "durationSeconds": 2.399002,
      "sha256": "2b61a3a63bf08b6edfe71a036c86aff64f5ba60b102e17fedaaf2c603e8fec26"
    },
    {
      "audioUrl": "/audio/learning/53e463d6503e5e4a6a22.m4a",
      "spokenText": "ことしわにほんにいきたいです。",
      "bytes": 20541,
      "durationSeconds": 2.512653,
      "sha256": "e9cf27f1e09e13b13346990de10a0993ed34def43043fbf0bb94f25903b71c1b"
    }
  ],
